<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54631" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανο-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>observe well, understand, apprehend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐμὲ κατανοέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				93
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ Χαλεπὸν τῷ βουλομένῳ
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				25.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ . . κατανοῶ τὸ νῦν ἐρωτώμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					233a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὅ τι λέγω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					455b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ πάνυ κατανοῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					48a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					264b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανοεῖς τίς ποτ᾽ ἐστίν . .
			</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				33.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖνο, ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.30U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τίνων . . καὶ πότε . . καὶ πῶς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.12.9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of a doctrine, <i>to be grasped and</i> hence
				<i>accepted</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶλλον μᾶλλον
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				138G.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς καρδίαν -εῖται</span>
			<i>is understood</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>perceive</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ κατανοουμένῳ τὸ
				κατανοοῦν ἐξομοιῶσαι</span>
			<i>the percipient to the perceived</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				90d
			</span></i>, etc.: c. part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. οὐ
				&lt;&gt;πολλοὺς ὄντας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>learn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Περσίδος γλώσσης ὅσα ἐδύνατο
					κατενόησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.138
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>consider</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>look at, view</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					5.179a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be in one's right mind, in one's senses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́</span>, <i><span class="en">
				5.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
